@startuml InMemory Entity Lifecycle State Machine
[*] --> Transient : Entity instantiated in memory (id is null)

Transient --> Persisted : save() called (id generated, stored in Tenant map)

Persisted --> Persisted : save() called again (updates fields)

Persisted --> Deleted : deleteById() called (removed from Tenant map)
Deleted --> [*]
@enduml
